lines+=['','Certified for the single complete oracle run below. `runs` means enclosing-body entries; parser runs are **namespace initializations (9), not parsed-file counts**. Non-callable values have zero calls. Existing function properties are counted as well as method signatures; only `*` members on public receiver types incur the proposed extra calls. Alias-local names, exact declarations and positions are in [heat.json](evidence/heat.json).','','## Price','','| Road | Public sites / wrappers | Extra calls per measured lane | Stock strictFunctionTypes diagnostics (79 roots) | Declaration result |','| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | --- |','| Baseline | — | 0 | 0 | Adapted baseline |','| All 11 receiver types: taken methods become properties | — | 0; JavaScript fingerprint unchanged for all 5 edited files | 1 (TS2322) | 34 public members change; 3 internal overloads exposed; normal `hereby dts` fails |','| Hybrid: internal/private types as properties, public sites as receiver arrows | 19 / 82 | **30,851,760** | **0** | Normal `hereby dts` passes; both public files byte-identical |','','Public-call breakdown: parser **18,022,708**, printer handlers **12,639,841**, the 17 transformer bindings **189,211**. Total counted local-member calls across all 29 sites, including existing function properties, were **61,753,448**. This is one observed run with the pinned workload and batching, not a universal constant or a wall-time forecast.','','The extra-call total is the measured number of calls through public method bindings multiplied by the proposal’s one forwarding call per use. Counter wall time is not arrow-overhead timing. Source recipes are private measurement experiments, not an Adamic adaptation or evidence of native compilation. No compiler implementation or rule changed.','','## Workload, controls and counter validity','','The unfiltered oracle used all runners and eight workers, with its unchanged **40,000 ms** hook timeout. Results were **106,366 passing, one failing, zero pending**. The sole failure was `unittests:: Public APIs for typescript.d.ts should be acknowledged when they change`; the sole baseline diff was `api/typescript.d.ts`. Install/build exited zero and tests exited one as expected. All eight worker snapshots were present; controls and discarded attempts are excluded. See [oracle-summary.json](evidence/oracle-summary.json).','','The counter wraps each local **after destructuring**, including defaults; it never proxies the source object. Strict forwarding functions preserve the receiver and argument list and retain name/length metadata. Original values are retained for six symbol-resolved identity comparisons: three printer sentinel checks and three non-callable preference comparisons. This preserves the default-sentinel shortcuts instead of creating artificial calls. Every function-valued taken member is counted, not just methods.','','Before the accepted lane, the default control recorded **1/1**, the supplied callback control **1/1**, and the parser/printer printed `const answer = 42;`. Sentinel controls confirmed default notification/substitution calls stayed zero; bare and explicit receivers were preserved. [controls.cjs](controls.cjs) and [controls-result.json](evidence/controls-result.json) retain the assertions and observations.','','All **80,520** test input/reference files were verified byte-identical to the baseline. Thirty nested node_modules fixture files and two nested built reference files omitted by an early copy were restored. Scratch was moved from tmpfs to disk; the private `.parallelperf.json` history was cleared for fresh-checkout batching. Incomplete, fixture-deficient, timed-out and OOM attempts were discarded. [test-input-verification.json](evidence/test-input-verification.json) records the accepted input inventory hash.','','## Full latent census and AST comparison','','All **24 files** holding the 29 AST sites were measured separately with `LATENT_FULL=1 LATENT_ASSERT_NO_OUTPUT=1`, one exact `LATENT_ONLY_FILE` per run, **CommonJSBundle**, a **3,600 second** limit per file and no overlapping measurement jobs. Every run exited zero, emitted exactly one selected-file record and ended with a relation trailer; none timed out.','','The census emitted **18 raw events** for `a method in object destructuring`, at **16 distinct locations / binding sites**. The extra two events repeat the module-specifier binding. No other reason is folded into that count. There are **13 AST-only sites** and **zero census-only sites** for the broader scan. The counter and hybrid price cover all 29 AST sites, not merely the 16 observed compiler refusals.','','| Selected file | AST sites | Distinct method refusals | Raw events | Seconds | Peak summed RSS (KiB) |','| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |']
